<title>USA: Schick to take charge in patent settlement.</title>
<headline>Schick to take charge in patent settlement.</headline>
<dateline>LONG ISLAND CITY, N.Y. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schick Technologies Inc said Monday that it has settled litigation between the company and Radworks Corp and the University of Texas relating to patent infringement disputes.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement consist of an aggregate $600,000 payment to Radworks and the University of Texas.</p>
<p>That amount will be incurred as a one-time charge against earnings in the first quarter ended June 30, 1997.</p>
</text>
